outcomes.description:
To determine and compare for each vaccine strategy:

* Frequency, type and severity of local and systemic solicited adverse events within 7 days following each vaccine administration;
* frequency, type and severity of unsolicited adverse events within 30 days following each vaccine administration; severe adverse events and adverse events of special interest until the end of study

